"explanation": "Based on Document 1, Uhldingen-Mühlhofen joined the company KIRU (Kommunale Informationsverarbeitung Reutlingen-Ulm) as a member municipality to gain access to IT solutions and services. Based on Document 2, Uhldingen-Mühlhofen became the first European member of the SGCNZ Young Shakespeare Company, a New Zealand-based theatre troupe. Both documents explicitly state that the municipality is a member of these respective organizations."
